  {
    "directory": "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14062908",
    "question": {
      "math_academy_id": "q-106608",
      "knowledge_point_id": "e6e4940d-fc80-563d-85a2-b83478cce6c5",
      "knowledge_point": "Finding the Parametric Equations of a Vertical Hyperbola Given Algebraically",
      "problem": "What are the parametric equations of the hyperbola $5{y}^{2}-4{x}^{2}=20?$",
      "worked_solution": "The parametric equations of a vertical hyperbola centered at the origin with Cartesian equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{{y}^{2}}{{a}^{2}}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{{b}^{2}}=1\n$$\n\nare given by\n\n$$\nx=b\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,y=a\\operatorname{sec}⁡t.\n$$\n\nFirst, we rewrite the equation of our hyperbola in standard form, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}5{y}^{2}-4{x}^{2} & =20 \\\\ \\frac{5{y}^{2}}{20}-\\frac{4{x}^{2}}{20} & =\\frac{20}{20} \\\\ \\frac{{y}^{2}}{4}-\\frac{{x}^{2}}{5} & =1\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, in our case, $a=\\sqrt{4}=2$ and $b=\\sqrt{5}.$ Therefore, the parametric equations are\n\n$$\nx=\\sqrt{5}\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,y=2\\operatorname{sec}⁡t.\n$$",
      "answer_fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices_complete": true,
          "choices": [
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "x=2\\sqrt{5}\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,y=4\\operatorname{sec}⁡t",
              "option": "0",
              "source_option": "a"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "x=4\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=2\\sqrt{5}\\operatorname{tan}⁡t",
              "option": "1",
              "source_option": "b"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "x=\\sqrt{5}\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,y=2\\operatorname{sec}⁡t",
              "option": "2",
              "source_option": "c"
            },
            {
              "type": "math",
              "value": "x=\\sqrt{5}\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,y=2\\operatorname{tan}⁡t",
              "option": "3",
              "source_option": "d"
            },
            {
